{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46729","headline":"寄栖白上人 · 齐己","name":"寄栖白上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国争名地，吾师独此闲。\n题诗招上相，看雪下南山。\n内殿承恩久，中条进表还。\n常因秋贡客，少得掩禅关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}